Notes is a **learning filesystem**. Folders nest. Files open as compact documents — smaller heroes than solutions, with breadcrumbs for where you are.

A note is just a customizable [[json-doc]]. You can share a URL with a friend and they can learn a concept without opening an editor.

```ts
// note shape (simplified)
type Note = {
  id: string
  title: string
  sections: { id: string; title: string; blocks: Block[] }[]
}
```
